The page is built with Vite, @sveltejs/vite-plugin-svelte and vite-plugin-singlefile (all MIT,
with esbuild and Rollup, also MIT, underneath), which are build-time tools only: nothing of
theirs ships in the page. The exact versions are pinned in web/package.json.

The page's controls (menus, sliders, switches, selects, the dialog, the tooltip, the
collapsible groups, the colour editors' popovers and the resizable panes) are shadcn-svelte components, copied into
web/src/lib/components/ui/ by the shadcn-svelte CLI and kept as the project's own files, over
Bits UI and PaneForge. They are used under the MIT licence, which is compatible with the Apache
License 2.0. The components' class names are Tailwind CSS utilities; the styles they generate
are built into the page's stylesheet.

