The page's Tools > Record rendering writes its MP4 videos with mp4-muxer, an MP4 multiplexer,
bundled into the page's inlined script. It is used under the MIT licence, which is compatible
with the Apache License 2.0. The video itself is encoded by the browser's own H.264 encoder
(WebCodecs); no encoder ships with the page. Its exact version is pinned in web/package.json
and web/deno.lock.

